# Ashling's Command, modes 1 and 2, CR 608.2b: if one target is illegal the spell still does what it can with the other. Bot1
# targets its Volcanic Villain and itself; in response Bot2 kills the Villain with Lightning Bolt. No token is made (the
# first mode has no legal target), but the second mode resolves and Bot1 draws two cards.

